 H←ORB OrbRotate X;INCL;I;OMEGA;O;OMEG4;Q
⍝ Converts 2D orbital plane coordinates to 3D heliocentric
⍝ Accounts for orientation and tilt of each orbit in ORB
 X←((⍴X),1)⍴X←1 0 1\X
 OMEGA←RADIAN(Periangle ORB)-Ascending ORB
 OMEG4←RADIAN Ascending ORB
 INCL←RADIAN Inclination ORB
 I←INCLROTATE INCL
 O←LONGROTATE OMEGA
 Q←LONGROTATE OMEG4
 H←(Q TIMES I TIMES O)TIMES X
 H←(¯1↓⍴H)⍴H
